    "description": "Technical Lead \n•\tOrchestrate feature development and bug tracing processes for customers and partners\n•\tCo-operate closely with QA team by designing test cases and monitoring test result.\n\nSenior Video Engineer\n•\tAd signal processing (SCTE35/SCTE104) and ingestion to HLS, MPEG-DASH, RTMP and TS\n•\tClosed caption/subtitle processing for EIA 608/708, DVB Subtitle, OP47, DVB Teletext,Side Car subtitles files (SRT,TTML,SCC)\n•\tClosed caption/subtitle conversion to SEI messages, WebVTT, DFXP/ISMT, and MPEG-DASH EBU-TT subtitle standards.\n•\tFile format handling for VOD workflow (MXF, MP4, AVI, TS,DV,VOB,DV,ProRes etc). \n•\tFail over for redundancy\n•\tClipCasting\n•\tVideo conference solution based on the OpenH323\n\nVideo Streaming Engineer \n•\tImplemented most of industry standards such as Apple HLS, MPEG-DASH, RTP/RTSP, Adobe RTMP, Microsoft Smooth Streaming and Transport Stream\n•\tImplemented Interoperability with various streaming servers and CDNs such as Adobe FMS, IIS, USP, Wowza, Akamai, Level3, Limelight, Octoshape, Anevia etc. \n•\tAdaptive Multi-bitrate Service\n\nVideo Codec Engineer\n•\tImplemented video codec standards (MPEG-2, MPEG-4, H.263, H.264)\n•\tOptimized codec algorithm and performance for TI DSP and x86.\n•\tImplemented rate control/statistical rate control\n•\tImage processing algorithms for rescaling, de-interlacing and frame rate/format/color conversion.\n\n",
